WEBVTT

00:01.750 --> 00:03.080
<b>As promised,</b>

00:03.170 --> 00:06.210
<b>I've come up with a good idea for
something you can immerse yourself in</b>

00:06.290 --> 00:07.960
<b>while enjoying a normal student life.</b>

00:08.920 --> 00:11.130
<b>Have a seat, both of you.</b>

00:11.460 --> 00:13.630
<b>Wow, check out this room.</b>

00:13.710 --> 00:15.880
<b>Is your brother a scientist or something?</b>

00:15.960 --> 00:17.330
<b>H-He's just a nerd.</b>

00:17.420 --> 00:18.460
<b>Huh...</b>

00:19.000 --> 00:21.210
<b>Dude, this goes <i>way</i> beyond nerd!</b>

00:23.250 --> 00:27.420
<b><i>Tachibana then spent a while</i>
<i>playing the game we had made.</i></b>

00:28.500 --> 00:32.040
<b><i>Ozu's sister seemed to</i>
<i>enjoy it well enough, too.</i></b>

00:36.000 --> 00:41.000
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

00:41.540 --> 00:42.750
<b>#05 "MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER
KEEPS GETTING CLOSE TO ME"</b>

00:42.830 --> 00:44.290
<b>Well? What'd you think?</b>

00:44.630 --> 00:46.920
<b>Pretty mid.</b>

00:48.630 --> 00:51.710
<b>The art's meh, and the music sounds cheap.</b>

00:53.080 --> 00:54.080
<b>But...</b>

00:54.170 --> 00:58.630
<b>I can't believe I enjoyed it so much
based on gameplay alone.</b>

00:59.080 --> 01:00.960
<b>Why did I get so into it?</b>

01:01.080 --> 01:02.210
<b>That's it!</b>

01:03.380 --> 01:05.290
<b>The gameplay!</b>

01:05.380 --> 01:07.710
<b>What you just said is the answer!</b>

01:08.790 --> 01:10.920
<b>In essence, a video game
is just a game of pretend.</b>

01:11.000 --> 01:13.420
<b>Pretend? What do you mean?</b>

01:13.500 --> 01:16.380
<b>Rock-paper-scissors, tag,
hide-and-seek, dodgeball...</b>

01:16.460 --> 01:18.380
<b>We all played those a lot
in grade school, right?</b>

01:18.460 --> 01:20.750
<b>Yeah, so much that I got sick of them.</b>

01:20.830 --> 01:22.250
<b>Did you really, though?</b>

01:22.330 --> 01:26.170
<b>Well, I'd probably have fun
if I played them now, I guess.</b>

01:26.250 --> 01:27.750
<b>Right? That's because...</b>

01:28.130 --> 01:31.460
<b>they're some of the most perfect,
complete games out there.</b>

01:32.290 --> 01:35.290
<b>The rules are simple,
and the conditions for winning are clear.</b>

01:35.380 --> 01:37.630
<b>Players just strive to win, nothing more.</b>

01:37.710 --> 01:39.540
<b>Video games are the same way, right?</b>

01:40.130 --> 01:41.210
<b>Good point.</b>

01:41.290 --> 01:45.040
<b>A truly good game doesn't need
showiness to be entertaining.</b>

01:45.130 --> 01:47.290
<b>Even on a low budget,
if we just put in the work,</b>

01:47.380 --> 01:50.630
<b>we can make a game that'll
captivate fans around the world!</b>

01:51.500 --> 01:54.130
<b>The one hurdle every game
creator needs to overcome</b>

01:54.210 --> 01:56.580
<b>is finding sufficient programming
knowledge and technique,</b>

01:57.000 --> 01:59.920
<b>but Ozu can bring any idea to life.</b>

02:00.750 --> 02:05.080
<b>Like you said, though,
the music is pretty low-quality.</b>

02:05.170 --> 02:06.500
<b>The music...</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:11.000
<b>If only we knew someone
who could compose good music.</b>

02:11.880 --> 02:13.750
<b>What are you getting at?</b>

02:14.250 --> 02:17.960
<b>Would you two... be interested
in developing the game with us?</b>

02:18.380 --> 02:22.170
<b>A game? Wait... Me, too?</b>

02:22.250 --> 02:23.540
<b>But I can't do anything—</b>

02:23.630 --> 02:26.960
<b>Not a problem!
You're Ozu's sister, so you're in!</b>

02:27.080 --> 02:28.710
<b>There's plenty to be done, anyway.</b>

02:28.790 --> 02:30.500
<b>That seems kinda careless!</b>

02:31.630 --> 02:34.630
<b>Honestly, I'm kinda intrigued,</b>

02:35.630 --> 02:39.880
<b>but I could never betray Otoi-senpai
after all she's done for me!</b>

02:40.330 --> 02:42.330
<b>I already got her approval, actually.</b>

02:42.420 --> 02:43.460
<b>What?!</b>

02:43.790 --> 02:46.460
<b><i>I'm totally okay with Asagi's creative pursuits.</i></b>

02:46.750 --> 02:48.130
<b><i>I encourage them, in fact.</i></b>

02:49.460 --> 02:53.960
<b>Well, make your choice.
Decide for yourself if you want to do it or not.</b>

02:54.540 --> 02:55.710
<b>Nothing more.</b>

02:57.880 --> 03:01.540
<b>If it means Iroha won't end up a delinquent,
I agree it's for the best!</b>

03:01.630 --> 03:02.960
<b>Tachibana-san!</b>

03:03.290 --> 03:05.880
<b>You should definitely do this, too!</b>

03:05.960 --> 03:08.960
<b>If we help them, we get to play
fun games all we want, right?</b>

03:09.420 --> 03:12.960
<b>We can say goodbye to the boring lives
we've had until now!</b>

03:14.790 --> 03:18.210
<b>I'm sorry. I'll have to pass.</b>

03:20.920 --> 03:23.540
<b>Tachibana-san, I'm sorry
to put you through all this.</b>

03:23.630 --> 03:26.170
<b>I won't ask you to let me be
part of your group anymore.</b>

03:26.250 --> 03:29.880
<b>Iroha... Come on, don't make this all sad.</b>

03:29.960 --> 03:31.920
<b>You're talking like we'll
never see each other again.</b>

03:32.000 --> 03:33.670
<b>No, I'm not saying that.</b>

03:34.380 --> 03:37.670
<b>If you do another street performance,
call me, okay? I'll be there.</b>

03:38.750 --> 03:41.250
<b>Well, I'm glad to hear that, but...</b>

03:41.330 --> 03:44.880
<b>Oh! You're going to have a
game dev meeting now, right?</b>

03:44.960 --> 03:47.540
<b>I'm sure I'd just be in the way,
so I'll step out for a bit.</b>

03:47.630 --> 03:48.710
<b>Iroha! Wait a—</b>

03:50.920 --> 03:51.960
<b>Man, she left quick!</b>

03:52.040 --> 03:54.000
<b>You guys wait here.</b>

04:02.210 --> 04:04.170
<b>Hold up, hold up, hold up.</b>

04:04.250 --> 04:07.330
<b>Hey, yo. Why'd you run away?</b>

04:07.420 --> 04:10.790
<b>Making a game with them
sounds fun as hell, yo.</b>

04:11.170 --> 04:13.960
<b>I... I think so, too.</b>

04:14.080 --> 04:17.420
<b>It's not like Iroha-chan actually wanted
to be a delinquent or anything.</b>

04:17.670 --> 04:19.960
<b>I get what you're both saying.</b>

04:20.040 --> 04:24.880
<b>But when I saw how Tachibana-san reacted
when they asked us to help them,</b>

04:24.960 --> 04:26.630
<b>it made me see the truth all over again.</b>

04:26.710 --> 04:27.960
<b>What truth, yo?</b>

04:28.670 --> 04:32.750
<b>Tachibana-san has her desire to
play music that keeps her centered,</b>

04:32.830 --> 04:35.790
<b>so she can be anywhere and still be herself.</b>

04:36.080 --> 04:38.710
<b>And you don't have anything like that?</b>

04:39.170 --> 04:40.750
<b>Of course I don't.</b>

04:40.830 --> 04:43.880
<b>I just looked up to Tachibana-san
because I envied her. That was all.</b>

04:43.960 --> 04:46.750
<b>It's not like I had something
I actually wanted to do.</b>

04:46.830 --> 04:49.170
<b>I just wanted to be like her.</b>

04:49.250 --> 04:53.130
<b>Oh, no! That's what they call
being a wannabe, y'know!</b>

04:54.290 --> 04:55.580
<b>No mercy at all, huh?</b>

04:56.210 --> 04:58.130
<b>But... I think you're right.</b>

04:58.580 --> 05:01.130
<b>Iroha-chan, are you... holding back?</b>

05:01.540 --> 05:03.040
<b>Holding back?</b>

05:04.210 --> 05:09.330
<b>You always... avoid putting
yourself out there, you know?</b>

05:10.670 --> 05:12.420
<b>That's because...</b>

05:12.540 --> 05:13.580
<b>Hey, you.</b>

05:14.130 --> 05:16.130
<b>You shouldn't do that.</b>

05:17.920 --> 05:19.580
<b>Wow...</b>

05:20.830 --> 05:21.960
<b>Wh-Wh...</b>

05:23.000 --> 05:24.290
<b>Why are you here?!</b>

05:25.380 --> 05:26.500
<b>He saw me.</b>

05:27.250 --> 05:28.670
<b>He saw me! He saw me!</b>

05:29.080 --> 05:32.330
<b>Yes, I did, but don't worry!</b>

05:32.420 --> 05:33.920
<b>I'm not freaked out or anything!</b>

05:34.000 --> 05:37.710
<b>That's what everyone says
when they're actually freaked out!</b>

05:38.830 --> 05:40.670
<b>I mean, yeah, I was at first.</b>

05:40.750 --> 05:42.210
<b>But don't worry!</b>

05:42.290 --> 05:45.880
<b>After a while, all I could think of
was that your acting was incredible.</b>

05:45.960 --> 05:48.630
<b>So you <i>were</i> freaked out at first!</b>

05:48.710 --> 05:52.290
<b>If you think I'm not gonna worry about it
just 'cuz you said not to, you're very wrong!</b>

05:52.380 --> 05:54.250
<b>Stop nitpicking every detail!</b>

05:54.330 --> 05:57.170
<b>A bit of insensitivity makes life richer!</b>

05:57.250 --> 05:59.460
<b><i>Now</i> you're gonna patronize me?!</b>

05:59.790 --> 06:02.880
<b>You're entirely to blame
in this situation, you know!</b>

06:04.170 --> 06:06.000
<b><i>I can't argue with that.</i></b>

06:07.330 --> 06:11.880
<b>Look, Ozu's sister, I won't tell
anyone what I just saw, okay?</b>

06:12.790 --> 06:14.880
<b>So can you not glare at me like that?</b>

06:14.960 --> 06:17.460
<b>You're planning to blackmail
me instead, aren't you?</b>

06:17.540 --> 06:20.420
<b>- You're gonna ask me to do something dirty!
- No, I won't!</b>

06:21.210 --> 06:24.750
<b>You really are unusual, Ohboshi-senpai.</b>

06:24.830 --> 06:26.750
<b>I'm aware of that.</b>

06:29.080 --> 06:30.960
<b>That makes you even more evil.</b>

06:33.670 --> 06:36.670
<b>Hey, so... That one-woman act
you were doing...</b>

06:36.750 --> 06:38.460
<b>Do you have to reopen that wound?</b>

06:38.960 --> 06:42.290
<b>I was genuinely impressed
by your acting ability.</b>

06:42.960 --> 06:44.170
<b>Huh?</b>

06:44.250 --> 06:46.920
<b>At first, when I was only hearing the voices,</b>

06:47.000 --> 06:48.750
<b>I thought there were three people.</b>

06:49.250 --> 06:53.420
<b>Three people with totally
different personalities and voices.</b>

06:53.500 --> 06:55.500
<b>But it was totally weird, wasn't it?</b>

06:55.920 --> 06:58.250
<b>Seeing you doing it
didn't make it any less amazing.</b>

06:58.330 --> 07:00.960
<b>In fact, seeing that it was just you
impressed me even more.</b>

07:03.380 --> 07:08.040
<b>R-Really? Well, thanks... I guess?</b>

07:08.790 --> 07:10.830
<b>You've made a fan out of me.</b>

07:11.130 --> 07:12.170
<b>Huh?</b>

07:13.000 --> 07:15.460
<b>But that wasn't anything special.</b>

07:15.540 --> 07:18.380
<b>I was just playing around to stave off boredom.</b>

07:19.880 --> 07:24.670
<b>I used to think the characters I saw in
Sunday morning anime as a kid were cute,</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:26.250
<b>so I'd mimic them.</b>

07:26.330 --> 07:28.960
<b>Every kid goes through that at least once.</b>

07:29.080 --> 07:30.330
<b>I guess so, huh?</b>

07:30.750 --> 07:36.080
<b>But for some reason, the moment
my mom saw me doing it, she went nuts.</b>

07:36.540 --> 07:40.540
<b>She got all angry, and then sad.
That was when it all began.</b>

07:40.630 --> 07:43.880
<b>She made me avoid fun things and
focus on studying from then on.</b>

07:43.960 --> 07:45.420
<b>Did you ask her why?</b>

07:45.710 --> 07:48.960
<b>I never found out. She wouldn't tell me.</b>

07:49.080 --> 07:53.790
<b>But when I saw how sad she looked,
I couldn't bring myself to say any more.</b>

07:54.330 --> 07:57.420
<b>So that's why you just do
as your mom says now?</b>

07:57.500 --> 07:58.630
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:58.710 --> 08:03.880
<b>But I got so bored once we
didn't have a TV anymore.</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:08.880
<b>I started making up my own
stories and acting them out,</b>

08:08.960 --> 08:12.080
<b>but I have no talent for
creating stories or characters,</b>

08:12.170 --> 08:16.420
<b>so I just base them on classmates
or people I see around.</b>

08:16.880 --> 08:19.790
<b>Ah, so that's why they
sounded so stereotypical.</b>

08:21.790 --> 08:26.170
<b>Still, it's impressive enough that you
can act that well without a script.</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:30.540
<b>Y-You think so?</b>

08:31.040 --> 08:34.420
<b>Wait, so do you do drama or something?</b>

08:34.790 --> 08:35.830
<b>Nope.</b>

08:36.880 --> 08:41.040
<b>But my mom does makeup for actors and stuff,</b>

08:41.130 --> 08:44.080
<b>and I went on location with her
a bunch of times when I was little.</b>

08:44.170 --> 08:45.460
<b>Wow...</b>

08:45.540 --> 08:47.750
<b>Your acting ability is exceptional.</b>

08:48.170 --> 08:51.750
<b>And I've seen a lot of actors,
so you can trust my judgment.</b>

08:54.290 --> 08:56.790
<b>It's sort of embarrassing
when you praise me so sincerely.</b>

08:56.880 --> 09:00.250
<b>You must be good at seeing
people for who they are.</b>

09:00.330 --> 09:03.500
<b>That's why you can portray them so
realistically just from looking at them.</b>

09:04.170 --> 09:08.210
<b>When you put it that way... Maybe so.</b>

09:08.290 --> 09:10.250
<b>I just never realized it before.</b>

09:11.170 --> 09:13.830
<b>But you can't bring yourself
to betray your mom,</b>

09:13.920 --> 09:16.330
<b>and things between you and Ozu are awkward.</b>

09:16.420 --> 09:18.670
<b>Well... yeah.</b>

09:18.750 --> 09:23.500
<b>I figure he doesn't want
anything to do with me,</b>

09:23.580 --> 09:26.540
<b>and as far as Mom goes...
frankly, you hit the nail on the head.</b>

09:27.330 --> 09:30.250
<b>So you wanted an outsider to
twist your arm into it by force.</b>

09:30.920 --> 09:33.790
<b>And when some delinquents reached out to you,</b>

09:33.880 --> 09:36.330
<b>you thought you'd get them to change you</b>

09:36.420 --> 09:38.630
<b>in a way that absolved you of responsibility.</b>

09:41.210 --> 09:44.080
<b>Sorry if I hit a sore spot.</b>

09:44.170 --> 09:47.500
<b>No, it's fine. That's probably the truth.</b>

09:47.880 --> 09:51.080
<b>I'll drag you into something fun by force</b>

09:51.170 --> 09:53.880
<b>and coerce you to break your mom's rules!</b>

09:54.960 --> 09:59.420
<b>So would you entrust the life
of Kohinata Iroha to me?</b>

10:03.250 --> 10:07.580
<b>My life? When did the stakes
get raised so high?!</b>

10:07.670 --> 10:08.830
<b>You enjoy it, don't you?</b>

10:08.920 --> 10:09.960
<b>Enjoy what?</b>

10:10.080 --> 10:12.290
<b>Acting. Portraying someone else.</b>

10:12.670 --> 10:16.210
<b>Well... it's pretty much
all I've ever done, so...</b>

10:16.830 --> 10:20.130
<b>Then isn't this exactly the path
an actor should follow?</b>

10:21.790 --> 10:25.830
<b>Not a mere mimicry of Tachibana,
but a dream for Kohinata Iroha alone.</b>

10:25.920 --> 10:27.540
<b>Doesn't that feel right?</b>

10:27.630 --> 10:29.080
<b>An actor...</b>

10:29.540 --> 10:31.880
<b>Let's work on the game together.</b>

10:32.750 --> 10:34.500
<b>Ohboshi-senpai...</b>

10:35.130 --> 10:38.130
<b>We'll take precautions to make sure
your mom doesn't find out.</b>

10:38.210 --> 10:39.380
<b>So please!</b>

10:39.880 --> 10:42.290
<b>Why do you sound so desperate?</b>

10:42.750 --> 10:44.380
<b>I'm just a stranger to you.</b>

10:44.790 --> 10:48.380
<b>Because you're Ozu's sister.
I'm not doing it for you.</b>

10:52.960 --> 10:54.960
<b>You won't give up partway?</b>

10:55.080 --> 10:56.420
<b>Absolutely not.</b>

10:56.500 --> 11:00.630
<b>I'll support your endeavors as Ozu's sister
as though they were Ozu's own.</b>

11:00.710 --> 11:02.830
<b>Could you stop that?</b>

11:03.420 --> 11:06.130
<b>Referring to me only as
his sister is just weird.</b>

11:06.210 --> 11:08.000
<b>Please call me by my given name.</b>

11:08.790 --> 11:09.920
<b>Iroha-san?</b>

11:10.000 --> 11:11.790
<b>Is there any need for the honorific?</b>

11:12.250 --> 11:13.290
<b>Iroha.</b>

11:13.750 --> 11:14.830
<b>Okay.</b>

11:16.080 --> 11:17.830
<b>I look forward to working with you,</b>

11:18.920 --> 11:20.380
<b>Ohboshi-senpai.</b>

11:22.080 --> 11:25.080
<b>MY FRIEND'S LITTLE SISTER HAS IT IN FOR ME!</b>

11:28.790 --> 11:32.080
<b><i>A week later, I invited Iroha over.</i></b>

11:33.670 --> 11:35.790
<b>I knew you only wanted me for my body.</b>

11:35.880 --> 11:38.330
<b>What the?! What led you to that conclusion?!</b>

11:39.000 --> 11:43.080
<b>You invite me to your place just days
after telling me you'll reform me.</b>

11:43.170 --> 11:44.670
<b>This always leads to...</b>

11:44.750 --> 11:48.830
<b>That would never fly in this age of
increasingly strict accountability!</b>

11:49.250 --> 11:52.170
<b>I won't lock the door, and you can
keep your phone on hand at all times.</b>

11:52.250 --> 11:55.080
<b>If anything I do seems remotely
suspicious, you can report me!</b>

11:55.170 --> 11:56.630
<b>Just get in here, please!</b>

11:57.580 --> 12:00.170
<b>Very well, then, if you insist.</b>

12:02.960 --> 12:04.630
<b>Have a seat wherever.</b>

12:04.710 --> 12:05.710
<b>Can I get you a drink?</b>

12:05.790 --> 12:09.330
<b>I'll pass. Wouldn't want you
slipping me a sleeping drug.</b>

12:09.420 --> 12:10.710
<b>I wouldn't do that.</b>

12:13.040 --> 12:14.040
<b>BEGINNING ACTING: A TRAINING MANUAL</b>

12:14.130 --> 12:15.210
<b>Are these...</b>

12:15.500 --> 12:17.960
<b>Some references that
might help with your acting.</b>

12:18.040 --> 12:20.750
<b>Did you buy these, Ohboshi-senpai?</b>

12:20.830 --> 12:24.630
<b>Well, yeah. I can't expect you to
use your allowance on this stuff,</b>

12:24.710 --> 12:26.920
<b>and you probably can't keep
books like that at home.</b>

12:27.000 --> 12:29.500
<b>I don't think she'd find out
if I hid books in my room.</b>

12:29.580 --> 12:31.750
<b>Oh, she would. She absolutely would.</b>

12:31.830 --> 12:33.630
<b>You sound so sure about that.</b>

12:35.420 --> 12:39.250
<b>All boys in Japan know
just how terrifying mothers are.</b>

12:39.330 --> 12:41.920
<b>No matter how exemplary your hiding spot,</b>

12:42.000 --> 12:43.210
<b>she <i>will</i> find it.</b>

12:43.290 --> 12:44.330
<b>Right...</b>

12:44.830 --> 12:47.170
<b>So I'll keep them at my place.</b>

12:47.250 --> 12:51.420
<b>I see. And that'll be your excuse
to get me to come over regularly.</b>

12:51.500 --> 12:52.750
<b>Don't call it an excuse!</b>

12:52.830 --> 12:55.920
<b>I don't wanna do anything that
might cause misunderstandings, either!</b>

12:57.920 --> 12:59.250
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

12:59.330 --> 13:04.630
<b>I shouldn't keep suspecting the worst of you
when you've done so much to help me.</b>

13:04.710 --> 13:06.250
<b><i>She's being so meek.</i></b>

13:06.330 --> 13:09.250
<b><i>It makes her really seem</i>
<i>like an honors student.</i></b>

13:09.330 --> 13:14.210
<b>W-Well, that suspicion is something
every girl your age should have.</b>

13:16.130 --> 13:18.420
<b><i>To clear up any suspicions Iroha had,</i></b>

13:18.500 --> 13:20.830
<b><i>and to help her feel safe</i>
<i>entrusting her time to me,</i></b>

13:20.920 --> 13:24.380
<b><i>I decided to draw a firm line</i>
<i>separating my emotions from the work.</i></b>

13:25.130 --> 13:29.040
<b><i>And thus our secret time together—</i>
<i>just the two of us—began.</i></b>

13:29.630 --> 13:33.130
<b><i>We started working on her</i>
<i>physical strength and vocalization,</i></b>

13:33.540 --> 13:35.630
<b><i>watching videos of acting classes,</i></b>

13:35.920 --> 13:37.630
<b><i>sharing our thoughts on movies,</i></b>

13:38.130 --> 13:40.130
<b><i>and dubbing anime with the sound off.</i></b>

13:40.670 --> 13:45.710
<b><i>Iroha and I spent time practically</i>
<i>every day working on her acting.</i></b>

13:46.380 --> 13:47.630
<b><i>Thus, Iroha—</i></b>

13:47.920 --> 13:51.210
<b><i>the actress named</i>
<i>Kohinata Iroha—began to bloom.</i></b>

13:52.710 --> 13:56.130
<b><i>And with the new term,</i>
<i>Ozu and I began our third year.</i></b>

13:56.960 --> 13:59.330
<b>Hey, glad you guys could make it.</b>

13:59.710 --> 14:02.330
<b>So your reason for calling us here must be...</b>

14:02.420 --> 14:05.420
<b>Yeah, it's done. The Otoi Studio is ready.</b>

14:05.500 --> 14:06.920
<b>Oh, wow! Finally, huh?</b>

14:07.000 --> 14:08.250
<b>So where is it?</b>

14:10.380 --> 14:11.580
<b>A storehouse?!</b>

14:12.460 --> 14:14.880
<b><i>Otoi started to change after that, too.</i></b>

14:14.960 --> 14:19.500
<b><i>She set up a sound studio for Tachibana</i>
<i>and the other delinquents in their circle.</i></b>

14:20.080 --> 14:21.710
<b>Wow, this is impressive.</b>

14:21.790 --> 14:22.960
<b>It's the real deal.</b>

14:23.080 --> 14:28.960
<b>I convinced my grandparents to give me
my part of the inheritance super early.</b>

14:29.080 --> 14:30.920
<b>You went that far?!</b>

14:31.000 --> 14:32.670
<b>You've really invested your life in this.</b>

14:32.750 --> 14:35.290
<b>Hey, don't talk like this
has nothing to do with you.</b>

14:35.380 --> 14:37.670
<b>You're the reason we're all in this together.</b>

14:37.750 --> 14:40.000
<b><i>It kinda hurts when you put it that way.</i></b>

14:40.500 --> 14:43.880
<b><i>Honestly, I'm just grateful that</i>
<i>we can record essentially for free.</i></b>

14:43.960 --> 14:45.210
<b><i>Otoi, you're a goddess!</i></b>

14:45.290 --> 14:49.460
<b><i>No... it feels wrong to just call her</i>
<i>"Otoi" with no honorific now.</i></b>

14:50.290 --> 14:53.040
<b><i>Perhaps I should call her "Otoi-san."</i></b>

14:54.000 --> 14:56.210
<b>Um, can I see the booth?</b>

14:56.290 --> 15:00.500
<b>Go for it. That's the part
that'll matter most to you, anyway.</b>

15:01.170 --> 15:04.130
<b>Anyway, Aki, how're you gonna
find other voice actors?</b>

15:04.500 --> 15:05.880
<b>Look around online?</b>

15:07.420 --> 15:09.420
<b>No, that won't be necessary.</b>

15:10.750 --> 15:13.250
<b>Iroha will do all of the voices.</b>

15:14.750 --> 15:18.750
<b>That's crazy. Doesn't the game
have a ton of characters?</b>

15:18.830 --> 15:20.630
<b>I'm guessing some of them are male, too.</b>

15:20.710 --> 15:23.920
<b>There was a time when I shared your worries.</b>

15:24.750 --> 15:26.790
<b>I'm ready anytime.</b>

15:26.880 --> 15:30.670
<b>Okay. Show Otoi-san what you can do!</b>

15:30.750 --> 15:31.960
<b>Right!</b>

15:32.670 --> 15:35.250
<b>Well, let's see it, then.</b>

15:52.080 --> 15:53.920
<b>Seriously?</b>

15:54.000 --> 15:57.040
<b>She's more impressive
than I ever could've imagined.</b>

15:57.250 --> 15:58.290
<b>Right?</b>

15:58.830 --> 16:00.880
<b>Why are <i>you</i> being so smug?</b>

16:00.960 --> 16:03.710
<b>Because I'm her personal manager and producer.</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:06.250
<b>It's no exaggeration to say I raised her.</b>

16:07.380 --> 16:09.250
<b>Actually, I guess it is.</b>

16:09.920 --> 16:12.630
<b>She had the talent right from the start.</b>

16:13.420 --> 16:16.330
<b><i>And that's how Iroha's</i>
<i>voice acting work began,</i></b>

16:16.420 --> 16:19.130
<b><i>though it remained a secret</i>
<i>between just the three of us.</i></b>

16:19.960 --> 16:22.330
<b>That movie was so good!</b>

16:22.420 --> 16:24.250
<b>I'm glad you enjoyed it.</b>

16:24.330 --> 16:26.330
<b>He was just so cool!</b>

16:26.420 --> 16:29.790
<b>Oh? I guess you have
a soft spot for hot guys, too.</b>

16:30.130 --> 16:33.540
<b>It wasn't so much his looks
as his career and backstory.</b>

16:33.630 --> 16:37.460
<b>It just tantalizes the inner child!
It's so exciting!</b>

16:37.750 --> 16:39.960
<b>- That's surprising.
- What is?</b>

16:40.080 --> 16:43.250
<b>I thought only guys got excited
over that kind of thing.</b>

16:43.330 --> 16:46.580
<b>Hey, that kind of perspective
is outdated in this day and age.</b>

16:47.210 --> 16:48.580
<b>Good point.</b>

16:49.330 --> 16:53.880
<b>If you think girls don't understand
that kind of coolness, you're very wrong.</b>

16:53.960 --> 16:56.130
<b>Uh, I wasn't trying to make fun of you.</b>

16:56.210 --> 16:58.790
<b>I was just kidding.
I'm not angry or anything.</b>

16:58.880 --> 17:01.380
<b>This is nothing like how I am when I'm angry.</b>

17:01.460 --> 17:02.710
<b>What are you like, then?</b>

17:02.790 --> 17:04.960
<b>Cold shoulder. Won't even talk to you.</b>

17:05.040 --> 17:07.960
<b>Just imagining it is gut-wrenching.</b>

17:08.920 --> 17:11.500
<b>Just do your best not to let it happen!</b>

17:11.580 --> 17:12.630
<b>R-Right.</b>

17:13.250 --> 17:14.830
<b>I guess...</b>

17:15.250 --> 17:18.630
<b>that was kind of cocky of me. I apologize.</b>

17:20.750 --> 17:23.880
<b>Backing up a step after saying
something like that is so you.</b>

17:25.130 --> 17:28.750
<b>Acting all high-and-mighty and lecturing
people isn't my style, you know?</b>

17:28.830 --> 17:30.000
<b>True.</b>

17:31.580 --> 17:35.540
<b>Thanks... for everything today,
Ohboshi-senpai.</b>

17:35.790 --> 17:38.880
<b>Sure. It was nothing worth
thanking me for, though.</b>

17:39.710 --> 17:42.040
<b>Still, I never would've come here by myself.</b>

17:42.130 --> 17:43.330
<b>Really?</b>

17:43.420 --> 17:46.960
<b>I think I'm starting to understand
what my brother meant.</b>

17:47.920 --> 17:53.420
<b>"Being around Aki makes me feel like
there's a light shining on me," he said.</b>

17:59.380 --> 18:01.830
<b>You're like a star, Senpai.</b>

18:05.290 --> 18:06.670
<b>Y'know, 'cuz "Ohboshi" means "star"!</b>

18:06.750 --> 18:07.750
<b>That was a gag?</b>

18:12.210 --> 18:15.380
<b>Actually, I talked with my brother
for the first time in a while.</b>

18:15.460 --> 18:16.630
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

18:17.000 --> 18:19.460
<b>He's really enjoying making the game.</b>

18:20.420 --> 18:23.460
<b>He never really spoke to me or Mom.</b>

18:23.540 --> 18:28.170
<b>He just holed up in his room messing with his
machines, looking bored and expressionless.</b>

18:28.460 --> 18:32.130
<b>You're kidding, right?
I mean, messing with machines is...</b>

18:32.210 --> 18:34.750
<b>...what he does for fun.
That's what you thought, right?</b>

18:34.830 --> 18:39.080
<b>But he only looks like he's
having fun when he's around you.</b>

18:39.710 --> 18:45.080
<b>I think he's having so much fun right now
because you're right there with him.</b>

18:45.710 --> 18:47.960
<b>But I'm just his friend.</b>

18:48.250 --> 18:51.380
<b>Then maybe what he was looking for all along</b>

18:51.460 --> 18:54.920
<b>was someone who'd show curiosity toward him.</b>

18:57.040 --> 18:58.960
<b>You think so?</b>

19:00.130 --> 19:01.630
<b>I do.</b>

19:07.040 --> 19:08.130
<b>Here.</b>

19:15.670 --> 19:17.040
<b>Headphones?</b>

19:17.750 --> 19:21.790
<b>This might be presumptuous of me,
but they'll be useful for you, right?</b>

19:21.880 --> 19:24.330
<b>I can't keep these at home, though.</b>

19:24.420 --> 19:27.420
<b>Which is why they'll stay at my place.</b>

19:27.500 --> 19:32.210
<b>So when we watch movies or listen to music
at your place like we have before...</b>

19:32.290 --> 19:33.540
<b>Nope.</b>

19:33.630 --> 19:36.000
<b>Here. Take this. A spare key.</b>

19:37.540 --> 19:40.880
<b>Whenever you want to watch movies
or anime, or listen to music,</b>

19:40.960 --> 19:42.960
<b>you're free to come over as you please.</b>

19:43.040 --> 19:44.290
<b>You're sure?</b>

19:44.500 --> 19:45.540
<b>Yep.</b>

19:46.920 --> 19:50.250
<b>Thank you, Ohboshi-senpai!</b>

19:56.290 --> 19:58.670
<b>You took that from my place again.</b>

19:58.750 --> 20:00.500
<b>It's not like I didn't have permission!</b>

20:00.580 --> 20:02.580
<b>You gave it to me, after all!</b>

20:02.670 --> 20:06.040
<b>I wasn't expecting you to become
such a pain in my ass.</b>

20:06.130 --> 20:08.040
<b>Aw, you know you love it!</b>

20:08.130 --> 20:10.460
<b>You're head over heels for me,
aren't you, Senpai?</b>

20:10.540 --> 20:13.750
<b>For your talent! Don't cut that part out!</b>

20:16.040 --> 20:17.750
<b>As the bearer of a kaleidoscopic voice,</b>

20:18.630 --> 20:21.290
<b>you're undoubtedly a genius.</b>

20:24.420 --> 20:26.630
<b>I don't want you getting a big head, though.</b>

20:26.710 --> 20:29.710
<b>Aw, but I'm the type that needs praise to grow!</b>

20:30.710 --> 20:33.960
<b>So things really haven't changed at your place?</b>

20:34.290 --> 20:38.040
<b>If they had, I wouldn't be banned from
gracing your group with my cute face!</b>

20:39.460 --> 20:42.880
<b>I'm grateful to you, though, you know.</b>

20:42.960 --> 20:45.500
<b>It's thanks to you that I'm who I am now.</b>

20:45.580 --> 20:46.830
<b>I wonder about that.</b>

20:46.920 --> 20:51.130
<b>If you had someone who could truly nurture
your talents, you wouldn't need me.</b>

20:51.210 --> 20:52.540
<b>Like Tachibana.</b>

20:52.920 --> 20:56.460
<b>Yeah, she caught the eye of some
professional not long after that, huh?</b>

20:56.540 --> 20:58.290
<b>Going to the US to do music...</b>

20:58.380 --> 21:00.960
<b>I never could've created that
kind of opportunity for her.</b>

21:01.790 --> 21:05.580
<b>I think she's still grateful to you, though.</b>

21:05.670 --> 21:09.380
<b>That's why she's still doing
music for <i>Black Goat</i>.</b>

21:09.750 --> 21:13.080
<b>I just can't stand to see anyone
with once-in-a-lifetime talent</b>

21:13.170 --> 21:15.710
<b>in a place where they can't use it.</b>

21:15.790 --> 21:17.000
<b>That's all there is to it.</b>

21:17.330 --> 21:22.580
<b>You simply chose the most efficient
method for achieving success, right?</b>

21:23.380 --> 21:28.000
<b>But people found happiness as a result of
getting caught up in that efficient method.</b>

21:29.460 --> 21:32.880
<b>Your Iroha-san's opinion is that you
need to assume responsibility for that</b>

21:32.960 --> 21:34.580
<b>and accept our gratitude.</b>

21:35.630 --> 21:39.250
<b>That's why you came over?
To drive that nail in?</b>

21:39.790 --> 21:41.290
<b>Bingo!</b>

21:41.380 --> 21:43.420
<b>You're one meddling junior, aren't you?</b>

21:43.500 --> 21:46.670
<b>Well, that's only because I'm <i>your</i> junior!</b>

22:02.040 --> 22:04.830
<b>How's this? Do you find it calming?</b>

22:04.920 --> 22:06.170
<b>I do.</b>

22:06.670 --> 22:08.880
<b>Nice. I got one of those
rare sweet lines out of you.</b>

22:09.790 --> 22:12.790
<b>I wish you'd be a little more
honest from time to time.</b>

22:12.880 --> 22:14.250
<b>It makes me sad, you know?</b>

22:14.330 --> 22:15.380
<b>Sad?</b>

22:15.880 --> 22:19.380
<b>Being your "friend's little sister"
keeps a comfortable distance between us,</b>

22:19.460 --> 22:23.750
<b>but isn't it also nice to just
be able to call someone your friend?</b>

22:23.830 --> 22:26.250
<b>Will it bother you if we're not that close?</b>

22:27.750 --> 22:29.830
<b>I mean, of course it would.</b>

22:29.920 --> 22:31.540
<b>We're already in different grades.</b>

22:32.290 --> 22:35.420
<b>Wh-What difference
do those little details make?</b>

22:36.040 --> 22:41.080
<b>The point is, your self-abasing, gloomy
aura is irritating, so I want to change it!</b>

22:41.170 --> 22:42.710
<b>That's your Iroha-san's opinion.</b>

22:43.170 --> 22:44.830
<b><i>She might have a point.</i></b>

22:44.920 --> 22:49.960
<b><i>Since Mashiro joined us, there's been</i>
<i>a change in the balance of my relationships.</i></b>

22:50.040 --> 22:52.710
<b><i>I need to correct that immediately.</i></b>

22:52.790 --> 22:55.540
<b><i>Iroha's behavior tonight is a sign of that.</i></b>

22:57.380 --> 22:58.580
<b>Hey, Iroha...</b>

22:58.670 --> 22:59.670
<b>Yes?</b>

22:59.750 --> 23:01.670
<b>Want to do some shopping with me tomorrow?</b>

23:02.750 --> 23:03.880
<b>Huh?!</b>

23:06.250 --> 23:08.000
<b>I'll ask the others, too.</b>

23:08.460 --> 23:10.830
<b>Instead of just being my friend's sister,</b>

23:10.920 --> 23:13.500
<b>why don't we try being friends for a change?</b>

23:14.170 --> 23:16.290
<b>Translation: Becky Cottrill</b>

23:16.380 --> 23:18.670
<b>Subtitle Editing: Geoff Mazzolini
Subtitle Timing: Krzysztof Kunc</b>

23:18.750 --> 23:21.040
<b>Quality Control: Gabriella Ramirez
Translation Check: David Saylor</b>

23:21.130 --> 23:26.080
<b>WATCH AGAIN NEXT TIME</b>
